00:16:02.895 --> 00:16:04.596
Obviously all the woke stuff.

00:16:04.596 --> 00:16:06.865
First off, how did this
even get to your desk?

00:16:06.865 --> 00:16:10.102
Is there an issue, a real issue
with this in South Carolina?

00:16:10.102 --> 00:16:11.503
Are you just kind
of modeling this

00:16:11.503 --> 00:16:13.739
off what DeSantis
is doing down here?

00:16:13.739 --> 00:16:15.274
Or how did this to you?

00:16:15.274 --> 00:16:16.742
- Yeah, I celebrate all the
governors around the country

00:16:16.742 --> 00:16:19.411 align:start size:97% position:3%
who take very seriously
the importance relationship

00:16:19.411 --> 00:16:21.580
