and their teachers,

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:23.716 align:start size:84% position:16%
and Governor DeSantis
has led on this

00:16:23.716 --> 00:16:25.718
and we should give him a
lot of credit for doing so.

00:16:25.718 --> 00:16:27.486 align:start size:84% position:16%
What I've seen
across the country,

00:16:27.486 --> 00:16:31.590
I've been focused on school
choice and empowering parents

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:33.559
for the last nine years.

00:16:33.559 --> 00:16:38.163 align:start size:97% position:3%
I love the model that Jeb
Bush had and Rick Scott had,

00:16:38.163 --> 00:16:41.133 align:start size:84% position:16%
and now Ron DeSantis
has in Florida.

00:16:41.133 --> 00:16:43.135 align:start position:0%
But the truth is that governors
throughout the country,

00:16:43.135 --> 00:16:45.471
including Kim Reynolds in Iowa,

00:16:45.471 --> 00:16:47.072 align:start size:84% position:16%
