my kids' curriculum.

00:17:04.456 --> 00:17:06.625
I can't get into the school.

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:10.362 align:start size:84% position:16%
And then you hear
these parents in Iowa

00:17:10.362 --> 00:17:15.067 align:start size:94% position:6%
and in Virginia who are
concerned about their kids

00:17:15.067 --> 00:17:18.904 align:start size:88% position:13%
