before the election.

00:18:33.912 --> 00:18:35.380
- Absolutely.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:38.984
I think parents, Democrat
parents get this issue

00:18:38.984 --> 00:18:40.352
as well as Republican parents.

00:18:40.352 --> 00:18:43.188
This is an issue that
actually unites parents

00:18:43.188 --> 00:18:44.723
