00:18:44.723 --> 00:18:46.125
In South Carolina,

00:18:46.125 --> 00:18:49.495 align:start position:0%
they were stunned by the
developments across the country

00:18:49.495 --> 00:18:50.963
as it relates to your ability

00:18:50.963 --> 00:18:53.132
to have a gender identity group

00:18:53.132 --> 00:18:57.002 align:start size:97% position:3%
and to have teachers
feeling like they're forced

00:18:57.002 --> 00:18:58.871
to provide instruction.

00:18:58.871 --> 00:19:01.306
That is just antithetical

00:19:01.306 --> 00:19:03.142
