interest of a child

00:19:03.142 --> 00:19:05.077
to exclude the parent from any

00:19:05.077 --> 00:19:08.347
conversation around those
very important topics.

00:19:08.347 --> 00:19:12.384
And so this legislation would
pull money away from schools

00:19:12.384 --> 00:19:14.987
who refuse to comply with
what the law, by the way,

00:19:14.987 --> 00:19:17.089
of the land already is.

00:19:17.089 --> 00:19:19.591 align:start size:84% position:16%
Minors don't make
decisions in a vacuum.

00:19:19.591 --> 00:19:22.628 align:start size:84% position:16%
It requires a parental
supervision to make
those decisions.

00:19:22.628 --> 00:19:25.030
I have to reinforce that
by pulling the money away

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:26.965
so that we can make
them pay attention

00:19:26.965 --> 00:19:29.668
to what the law of
the land already is.

00:19:29.668 --> 00:19:31.436 align:start size:88% position:13%
- I always think it's
funny because I remember

00:19:31.436 --> 00:19:32.938
