00:19:34.706 --> 00:19:37.209
or we went down to DC, you'd
have to have a parental slip,

00:19:37.209 --> 00:19:38.477
but somehow now-

00:19:38.477 --> 00:19:40.145
- You can sign it, yeah.

00:19:40.145 --> 00:19:42.014 align:start size:88% position:13%
- But now you can
literally talk to a kid

00:19:42.014 --> 00:19:45.150 align:start position:0%
