00:19:50.455 --> 00:19:51.890 align:start size:97% position:3%
'Cause I think we're
roughly around, we're close.

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:52.724
- Today's my birthday.

00:19:52.724 --> 00:19:53.959
I am 57.

00:19:53.959 --> 00:19:54.960
