00:20:06.471 --> 00:20:07.906 align:start size:97% position:3%
Thank you so much.
- This is pretty sweet, man.

00:20:07.906 --> 00:20:08.840
This is pretty sweet.

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:11.009
All right, so you're 57, right?

00:20:11.009 --> 00:20:11.910
