00:20:12.844 --> 00:20:14.279
- I'm 46, so we're close enough.

00:20:14.279 --> 00:20:16.215
- 46, we're about the same.

00:20:16.215 --> 00:20:17.983 align:start size:88% position:13%
- You're sort of, I
guess that would be like

00:20:17.983 --> 00:20:19.218
