your late 70, 80s,

00:20:36.568 --> 00:20:38.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
where we're being governed
by all of these people,

00:20:38.337 --> 00:20:40.072 align:start size:81% position:19%
that it seems like
our generation

00:20:40.072 --> 00:20:43.976 align:start size:97% position:3%
was supposed to take the reins
