00:20:43.976 --> 00:20:45.277
Did something happen there

00:20:45.277 --> 00:20:47.713 align:start size:84% position:16%
that skipped us
over in a weird way?

00:20:47.713 --> 00:20:50.115
- You know, that's a
really great question.

00:20:50.115 --> 00:20:52.851 align:start size:84% position:16%
I am one of the older
Generation Xers.

00:20:52.851 --> 00:20:53.685
That's true.

00:20:53.685 --> 00:20:55.187
I will say this,

00:20:55.187 --> 00:20:57.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
